1
00:00:11,600 --> 00:00:13,800
Have you always thought

2
00:00:13,960 --> 00:00:15,400
this was a murder?

3
00:00:16,840 --> 00:00:18,360
You're a former criminal detective.

4
00:00:18,360 --> 00:00:20,560
Having sharp instincts is a good thing.

5
00:00:20,600 --> 00:00:22,640
But Gao Yuhai is a local celebrity.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:25,120
There are so many eyes on him.

7
00:00:25,240 --> 00:00:27,570
It's fine if you can
get to the bottom of it.

8
00:00:27,600 --> 00:00:29,280
But what if you make a mistake...

9
00:00:29,280 --> 00:00:30,400
Yes, I understand.

10
00:00:31,120 --> 00:00:33,850
I just want to use the tricycle
as a breakthrough.

11
00:00:34,960 --> 00:00:36,760
It's a clue worth investigating.

12
00:00:36,760 --> 00:00:37,720
If it turns out

13
00:00:38,680 --> 00:00:39,440
to be nothing in the end,

14
00:00:39,440 --> 00:00:40,300
I'll accept it.

15
00:00:40,920 --> 00:00:42,520
But what if there is something?

16
00:00:42,520 --> 00:00:43,980
I wouldn't be able to sleep

17
00:00:44,720 --> 00:00:46,050
if I didn't look into it,

18
00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:48,810
and I'd be unworthy of my badge.

19
00:00:49,120 --> 00:00:51,520
Are you trying to investigate Song Yanfei?

20
00:00:52,840 --> 00:00:53,640
Are you sure?

21
00:00:54,120 --> 00:00:55,240
You told me

22
00:00:55,240 --> 00:00:56,900
he was your childhood friend.

23
00:00:57,360 --> 00:00:58,090
Director Wu,

24
00:00:58,440 --> 00:00:59,900
I'm looking for the truth.

25
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:01,060
It has nothing to do

26
00:01:01,160 --> 00:01:02,120
with anyone

27
00:01:02,680 --> 00:01:03,740
or any friendship.

28
00:01:15,640 --> 00:01:18,170
Remember to report back
if anything comes up.

29
00:01:27,080 --> 00:01:28,680
Then let's talk about

30
00:01:28,920 --> 00:01:30,720
how you met Song Yanfei.

31
00:01:31,760 --> 00:01:33,160
Gao Yayan introduced us.

32
00:01:33,479 --> 00:01:34,960
How did you meet Gao Yayan?

33
00:01:35,520 --> 00:01:36,680
On the street.

34
00:01:37,400 --> 00:01:39,360
Not long after my dad died,

35
00:01:39,800 --> 00:01:41,640
my mom left us.

36
00:01:42,120 --> 00:01:43,680
I heard from the neighbors

37
00:01:44,160 --> 00:01:45,890
that she ran off with a rich guy.

38
00:01:46,720 --> 00:01:47,850
I didn't believe it.

39
00:01:48,400 --> 00:01:49,640
I saw her

40
00:01:51,200 --> 00:01:53,000
when I passed by a hotel that day.

41
00:01:58,440 --> 00:01:59,080
Si,

42
00:01:59,240 --> 00:02:00,400
isn't that your mom?

43
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,560
Why is she here?

44
00:02:02,080 --> 00:02:04,680
Even though the neighbors
gossip about my mom,

45
00:02:04,760 --> 00:02:05,840
deep down,

46
00:02:06,480 --> 00:02:08,039
I always think she's a good person.

47
00:02:08,039 --> 00:02:08,639
Get lost!

48
00:02:08,639 --> 00:02:09,840
My mom would give me

49
00:02:09,840 --> 00:02:11,039
whatever I asked for.

50
00:02:11,640 --> 00:02:12,480
But that day,

51
00:02:13,040 --> 00:02:16,040
it was like she became
a completely different person.

52
00:02:16,560 --> 00:02:17,600
Why are you here?

53
00:02:17,840 --> 00:02:18,600
Who is he?

54
00:02:18,600 --> 00:02:19,720
Let's go outside to talk.

55
00:02:19,720 --> 00:02:20,760
Say it right here.

56
00:02:21,000 --> 00:02:21,440
Tell me,

57
00:02:21,440 --> 00:02:22,500
who is this old man?

58
00:02:23,240 --> 00:02:23,920
Let go of me.

59
00:02:23,920 --> 00:02:25,040
I know who he is now.

60
00:02:27,480 --> 00:02:28,800
My mom followed me out. Si!

61
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:29,800
I thought she was going
to explain it to me,

62
00:02:29,800 --> 00:02:30,320
Si!

63
00:02:30,360 --> 00:02:31,600
and then come home with me,

64
00:02:31,600 --> 00:02:32,480
and promise me

65
00:02:32,480 --> 00:02:33,680
she'd cut ties

66
00:02:33,680 --> 00:02:34,280
with that old man forever.

67
00:02:34,280 --> 00:02:34,960
Take this money.

68
00:02:34,960 --> 00:02:35,400
To my surprise,

69
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:36,800
Mom is working. You should leave.

70
00:02:36,800 --> 00:02:38,160
she actually gave me a handful of cash.

71
00:02:38,160 --> 00:02:39,520
I don't want your dirty money!

72
00:02:39,520 --> 00:02:40,560
Just you wait!

73
00:02:41,200 --> 00:02:42,730
I was so depressed that day.

74
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:44,480
I couldn't figure out
how my mom could really be...

75
00:02:44,480 --> 00:02:46,079
A money-grubber like her...

76
00:02:46,520 --> 00:02:47,800
I made up my mind then

77
00:02:48,280 --> 00:02:49,520
that I'd never see her again,

78
00:02:49,520 --> 00:02:50,800
nor call her mom.

79
00:02:53,440 --> 00:02:55,079
Let her live with that old man.

80
00:02:55,079 --> 00:02:57,079
She can forget about ever
getting close to her son again.

81
00:02:57,079 --> 00:02:58,480
The more I thought about it,

82
00:02:58,480 --> 00:02:59,640
the more depressed I got,

83
00:02:59,640 --> 00:03:01,440
so I shouted at the river to vent.

84
00:03:01,640 --> 00:03:02,800
After I calmed down,

85
00:03:02,800 --> 00:03:04,460
I heard someone talking to me.

86
00:03:08,720 --> 00:03:09,480
Who are you?

87
00:03:09,840 --> 00:03:11,040
Do we know each other?

88
00:03:11,040 --> 00:03:11,720
That day,

89
00:03:11,720 --> 00:03:13,680
I was in no mood to talk to anyone.

90
00:03:13,800 --> 00:03:14,880
Little did I know

91
00:03:15,000 --> 00:03:16,560
we'd run into each other
the very next day.

92
00:03:16,560 --> 00:03:17,320
Drink up.

93
00:03:27,040 --> 00:03:27,920
Don't overthink it.

94
00:03:27,920 --> 00:03:29,040
We're adults now.

95
00:03:29,480 --> 00:03:30,720
Everyone has their own life

96
00:03:30,720 --> 00:03:31,440
to live.

97
00:03:32,200 --> 00:03:32,680
Cheers.

98
00:03:33,040 --> 00:03:34,079
Watch your mouth.

99
00:03:35,280 --> 00:03:36,560
Alright, alright.

100
00:03:36,560 --> 00:03:37,760
Let it go.

101
00:03:39,160 --> 00:03:39,960
Don't pull me.

102
00:03:40,480 --> 00:03:41,740
I'm going out for a bit.

103
00:04:03,320 --> 00:04:04,920
Who are you? What do you want?

104
00:04:05,920 --> 00:04:07,360
You're quite forgetful.

105
00:04:07,680 --> 00:04:09,040
You forgot me already?

106
00:04:12,240 --> 00:04:13,170
What do you want?

107
00:04:13,200 --> 00:04:14,720
I just drank your sweet water.

108
00:04:14,720 --> 00:04:15,840
I'll pay you back.

109
00:04:17,440 --> 00:04:18,440
You're young,

110
00:04:18,440 --> 00:04:19,970
but you have quite a temper.

111
00:04:20,959 --> 00:04:22,280
You didn't look too happy

112
00:04:22,280 --> 00:04:24,280
drinking with your friends in there.

113
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,280
Let's have a drink.

114
00:04:25,280 --> 00:04:25,720
My treat.

115
00:04:25,720 --> 00:04:26,320
Forget it.

116
00:04:26,520 --> 00:04:27,600
I told you last time.

117
00:04:27,600 --> 00:04:28,320
We don't know

118
00:04:28,320 --> 00:04:29,120
each other.

119
00:04:29,120 --> 00:04:29,920
There's

120
00:04:29,920 --> 00:04:30,760
no need.

121
00:04:32,640 --> 00:04:34,560
The man with your mom is my dad.

122
00:04:45,520 --> 00:04:46,840
We're in the same boat.

123
00:04:47,240 --> 00:04:47,900
Let's talk.

124
00:04:49,280 --> 00:04:51,280
Anyway, I just got to know Gao Yayan.

125
00:04:51,520 --> 00:04:52,360
She told me

126
00:04:52,480 --> 00:04:54,400
that although her dad hasn't remarried,

127
00:04:54,400 --> 00:04:57,400
he's been messing around
with a lot of women secretly.

128
00:04:58,200 --> 00:04:59,080
She's on the verge

129
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,240
of cutting ties with him.

130
00:05:00,240 --> 00:05:01,800
I felt we had a lot in common,

131
00:05:01,960 --> 00:05:03,490
so we got to know each other.

132
00:05:03,560 --> 00:05:04,820
Did you interact much?

133
00:05:05,160 --> 00:05:06,040
With Gao Yayan?

134
00:05:07,760 --> 00:05:08,560
Not really.

135
00:05:09,080 --> 00:05:10,400
We only met a few times.

136
00:05:10,840 --> 00:05:13,370
I actually interacted more
with Song Yanfei.

137
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:16,720
So you met Song Yanfei

138
00:05:17,280 --> 00:05:19,080
and the rest of them that night?

139
00:05:19,560 --> 00:05:20,040
Yeah.

140
00:05:20,040 --> 00:05:21,440
Aren't they dating?

141
00:05:22,840 --> 00:05:25,200
Then tell us the details.

142
00:05:27,400 --> 00:05:28,720
That day, Gao Yayan and I

143
00:05:28,720 --> 00:05:30,450
talked about my mom and her dad.

144
00:05:30,640 --> 00:05:31,760
We talked a lot,

145
00:05:32,159 --> 00:05:33,159
and drank quite a bit too.

146
00:05:33,159 --> 00:05:33,800
Cheers.

147
00:05:38,080 --> 00:05:38,880
Okay,

148
00:05:39,159 --> 00:05:40,760
you're my sister from now on.

149
00:05:40,840 --> 00:05:42,440
If you ever need anything,

150
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:44,040
I'll risk my life for you.

151
00:05:44,360 --> 00:05:44,800
Okay.

152
00:05:45,360 --> 00:05:46,240
But

153
00:05:46,240 --> 00:05:48,440
I don't need you to risk your life for me.

154
00:05:49,040 --> 00:05:51,560
I just hope you get better and better.

155
00:05:57,120 --> 00:05:58,480
How much did you drink?

156
00:05:59,159 --> 00:05:59,800
Yanfei,

157
00:05:59,800 --> 00:06:00,760
you're here.

158
00:06:00,840 --> 00:06:01,720
Come,

159
00:06:02,280 --> 00:06:03,480
let me introduce you.

160
00:06:06,640 --> 00:06:07,240
This is

161
00:06:07,520 --> 00:06:08,560
Bai Xiaosi.

162
00:06:09,160 --> 00:06:10,360
Just call him Xiaosi.

163
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:12,130
From today on, he's my brother.

164
00:06:12,560 --> 00:06:13,400
And this is

165
00:06:14,040 --> 00:06:15,320
Song Yanfei.

166
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:16,760
You can call him

167
00:06:16,920 --> 00:06:17,760
brother-in-law.

168
00:06:17,760 --> 00:06:18,520
Right?

169
00:06:21,640 --> 00:06:23,440
Brother-in-law, what do you do?

170
00:06:23,560 --> 00:06:24,960
Your brother-in-law is a director.

171
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:26,240
He's amazing.

172
00:06:26,920 --> 00:06:27,760
A director?

173
00:06:28,080 --> 00:06:28,960
Brother-in-law,

174
00:06:28,960 --> 00:06:30,120
can you help me plan

175
00:06:30,120 --> 00:06:31,120
my videos?

176
00:06:32,280 --> 00:06:32,760
Come on, brother-in-law,

177
00:06:32,760 --> 00:06:33,680
I'll drink to that.

178
00:06:33,680 --> 00:06:34,480
Let me tell you,

179
00:06:34,480 --> 00:06:36,240
your videos are nothing to him.

180
00:06:36,760 --> 00:06:37,760
How should I put it?

181
00:06:37,760 --> 00:06:38,960
When he takes action,

182
00:06:39,200 --> 00:06:40,240
everything works out.

183
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:40,840
Right?

184
00:06:41,960 --> 00:06:43,960
Alright, alright. Come on, cheers.

185
00:06:44,040 --> 00:06:45,440
We're family from now on.

186
00:06:45,480 --> 00:06:45,920
Okay.

187
00:06:53,159 --> 00:06:55,290
Did Song Yanfei ever plan your videos?

188
00:06:56,080 --> 00:06:56,800
Yes, he did.

189
00:06:56,800 --> 00:06:57,480
All my videos

190
00:06:57,480 --> 00:06:58,800
with high views

191
00:06:58,960 --> 00:07:00,240
were planned by him.

192
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:01,600
So,

193
00:07:01,680 --> 00:07:04,280
the viral video
where you impersonated a traffic cop

194
00:07:04,280 --> 00:07:06,120
was also planned by him, right?

195
00:07:07,520 --> 00:07:08,920
No, it wasn't.

196
00:07:08,920 --> 00:07:09,960
Or

197
00:07:10,360 --> 00:07:11,890
you just don't want to talk?

198
00:07:14,120 --> 00:07:15,080
I guess so.

199
00:07:15,480 --> 00:07:16,760
You guess so?

200
00:07:17,920 --> 00:07:19,560
Just tell the truth.

201
00:07:21,520 --> 00:07:23,800
He lives in a small courtyard
in the suburbs.

202
00:07:23,800 --> 00:07:25,800
I'd go hang out with him when I was free.

203
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:26,840
That day...

204
00:07:28,560 --> 00:07:30,090
Brother-in-law, I'm here.

205
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,000
Why are you here?

206
00:07:32,120 --> 00:07:32,960
What's up?

207
00:07:33,440 --> 00:07:35,570
Why do you have a broken tricycle here?

208
00:07:36,440 --> 00:07:37,840
What do you mean broken?

209
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,720
It's a souvenir, got it?

210
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:41,480
A souvenir?

211
00:07:42,240 --> 00:07:43,560
Who collects this junk?

212
00:07:43,560 --> 00:07:45,280
Even scrap dealers wouldn't take it.

213
00:07:45,280 --> 00:07:46,400
One man's meat

214
00:07:46,560 --> 00:07:47,800
is another man's poison.

215
00:07:47,800 --> 00:07:48,880
Don't you get it?

216
00:07:49,200 --> 00:07:49,720
No.

217
00:07:52,040 --> 00:07:52,960
It means

218
00:07:52,960 --> 00:07:54,480
this tricycle might mean

219
00:07:54,480 --> 00:07:55,520
nothing to you,

220
00:07:55,880 --> 00:07:57,240
but to your sister,

221
00:07:57,440 --> 00:07:58,370
it's a souvenir.

222
00:07:59,320 --> 00:08:00,880
And to some people,

223
00:08:02,400 --> 00:08:03,640
it's poison.

224
00:08:04,000 --> 00:08:04,720
Poison?

225
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:06,320
Isn't that highly toxic?

226
00:08:07,320 --> 00:08:08,920
I think you're highly toxic.

227
00:08:09,160 --> 00:08:09,820
Spit it out.

228
00:08:10,240 --> 00:08:11,170
What do you want?

229
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:13,600
It's about my videos again.

230
00:08:14,120 --> 00:08:14,800
What?

231
00:08:15,000 --> 00:08:16,000
Wuxia?

232
00:08:16,000 --> 00:08:16,880
Superman?

233
00:08:17,760 --> 00:08:18,880
Cross-dressing,

234
00:08:18,880 --> 00:08:19,800
Disney cartoons,

235
00:08:19,800 --> 00:08:20,600
I've tried them all.

236
00:08:20,600 --> 00:08:21,920
Nothing works.

237
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:24,090
I've got it all figured out for you.

238
00:08:24,320 --> 00:08:24,960
You

239
00:08:25,160 --> 00:08:26,760
need to think outside the box.

240
00:08:26,760 --> 00:08:28,220
And it has to be realistic.

241
00:08:29,280 --> 00:08:30,480
That sounds solid.

242
00:08:31,200 --> 00:08:33,000
Then tell me,

243
00:08:33,000 --> 00:08:34,640
how is it original and realistic?

244
00:08:34,640 --> 00:08:35,970
Are we talking out here?

245
00:08:36,559 --> 00:08:37,490
Let's go inside.

246
00:08:40,559 --> 00:08:41,360
Isn't it cool?

247
00:08:41,840 --> 00:08:43,039
That's amazing.

248
00:08:49,000 --> 00:08:51,600
So you playing a traffic cop

249
00:08:51,760 --> 00:08:54,240
was what Song Yanfei taught you that day?

250
00:08:54,520 --> 00:08:56,400
Yeah, he told me it would work.

251
00:08:56,640 --> 00:08:57,880
Disguised as a doctor,

252
00:08:57,880 --> 00:08:58,880
a security guard,

253
00:09:00,120 --> 00:09:01,050
and what else...

254
00:09:02,320 --> 00:09:04,520
Anyway, there were four or five of them.

255
00:09:05,360 --> 00:09:07,960
So that day you went
to the bar with Xiao Ze,

256
00:09:08,000 --> 00:09:10,460
you put on that act
in front of him on purpose?

257
00:09:13,000 --> 00:09:14,200
Tell the truth.

258
00:09:17,480 --> 00:09:18,760
I get it now.

259
00:09:19,000 --> 00:09:20,200
This whole case

260
00:09:20,440 --> 00:09:22,320
has nothing to do with you, Bai Xiaosi.

261
00:09:22,320 --> 00:09:24,120
You were just being used, right?

262
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:26,140
Right. I don't know anything.

263
00:09:26,360 --> 00:09:27,160
Answer me.

264
00:09:27,440 --> 00:09:29,120
Yes or no?

265
00:09:31,320 --> 00:09:32,320
I guess so.

266
00:09:32,600 --> 00:09:33,800
I did receive a call

267
00:09:33,800 --> 00:09:35,200
from Song Yanfei that day.

268
00:09:35,200 --> 00:09:38,800
He told me to go straight to the bar
and pretend to be a traffic cop.

269
00:09:39,160 --> 00:09:39,680
But

270
00:09:39,920 --> 00:09:42,250
whether it had anything
to do with Xiao Ze,

271
00:09:42,280 --> 00:09:43,960
I really don't know.

272
00:09:44,240 --> 00:09:45,400
Hello?

273
00:09:45,840 --> 00:09:46,760
Are you hanging out

274
00:09:46,760 --> 00:09:47,560
with your

275
00:09:47,560 --> 00:09:49,160
cosplay friends tonight?

276
00:09:49,680 --> 00:09:52,080
Yeah, I'm figuring out
what to dress up as.

277
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:53,680
A traffic cop.

278
00:09:54,040 --> 00:09:54,680
You can

279
00:09:55,120 --> 00:09:56,480
test it out.

280
00:09:58,280 --> 00:09:59,540
I don't really dare to.

281
00:09:59,640 --> 00:10:01,720
What if real cops catch me?

282
00:10:02,000 --> 00:10:03,760
Who told you to wear it outside?

283
00:10:03,960 --> 00:10:06,420
Can't you just bring it
and change at the bar?

284
00:10:06,560 --> 00:10:07,360
Listen to me.

285
00:10:07,880 --> 00:10:09,120
Go as a traffic cop,

286
00:10:09,120 --> 00:10:11,120
and you'll be the coolest guy there.

287
00:10:11,880 --> 00:10:13,200
Makes sense.

288
00:10:13,480 --> 00:10:15,560
I'll definitely turn heads in this.

289
00:10:15,840 --> 00:10:16,640
This is it.

290
00:10:17,320 --> 00:10:18,320
Which bar

291
00:10:18,600 --> 00:10:20,000
are you going to tonight?

292
00:10:20,160 --> 00:10:21,600
Du World. Why?

293
00:10:22,560 --> 00:10:23,360
Du World.

294
00:10:23,960 --> 00:10:24,820
Okay, nothing.

295
00:10:25,600 --> 00:10:27,200
Your sister and I might drop by

296
00:10:27,200 --> 00:10:28,400
if we have time.

297
00:10:28,640 --> 00:10:29,440
But maybe not.

298
00:10:30,000 --> 00:10:31,760
Okay, sure. No problem.

299
00:10:41,920 --> 00:10:42,720
Hey, Xiao Ze.

300
00:10:43,080 --> 00:10:44,040
What are you up to?

301
00:10:44,040 --> 00:10:45,120
Hey,

302
00:10:45,280 --> 00:10:45,940
I'm at home.

303
00:10:46,440 --> 00:10:48,280
I've got some inside information for you.

304
00:10:48,280 --> 00:10:49,160
Shen Xi

305
00:10:49,600 --> 00:10:50,840
is going to a bar

306
00:10:51,000 --> 00:10:52,460
called Du Shijie tonight.

307
00:10:52,560 --> 00:10:53,640
Do you want to go?

308
00:10:54,280 --> 00:10:54,960
Really?

309
00:10:55,920 --> 00:10:56,680
Of course.

310
00:10:57,360 --> 00:10:59,040
But maybe she won't go.

311
00:10:59,960 --> 00:11:01,090
But what if she does?

312
00:11:01,640 --> 00:11:02,200
Right.

313
00:11:02,560 --> 00:11:03,560
What if she does?

314
00:11:03,840 --> 00:11:04,360
I'm hanging up.

315
00:11:04,360 --> 00:11:05,480
I need to get ready.

316
00:11:05,920 --> 00:11:06,800
Thanks.

317
00:11:11,440 --> 00:11:12,760
According to Bai Xiaosi's confession,

318
00:11:12,760 --> 00:11:15,160
Song Yanfei did instruct him
to wear a period costume

319
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:17,400
and enter the woods
from the east side of the hill

320
00:11:17,400 --> 00:11:18,240
and drop the hemp rope

321
00:11:18,240 --> 00:11:19,920
under the designated crooked tree.

322
00:11:19,920 --> 00:11:20,840
The purpose was

323
00:11:21,000 --> 00:11:22,320
to attract public attention

324
00:11:22,320 --> 00:11:23,920
and become an internet celebrity

325
00:11:23,920 --> 00:11:25,720
if someone secretly filmed him.

326
00:11:27,040 --> 00:11:27,920
It seems

327
00:11:28,040 --> 00:11:28,760
this Song Yanfei

328
00:11:28,760 --> 00:11:31,240
is connected to almost everyone.

329
00:11:33,600 --> 00:11:34,240
Chief Wu,

330
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:36,680
judging solely from the current situation,

331
00:11:36,680 --> 00:11:37,520
Bai Xiaosi

332
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:40,120
was only responsible for throwing
the hemp rope into the woods.

333
00:11:40,120 --> 00:11:43,480
As for whether Shen Xi used
the hemp rope to kill Xiao Ze...

334
00:11:43,560 --> 00:11:45,160
Or if Xiao Ze hanged himself

335
00:11:45,200 --> 00:11:47,200
with the hemp rope out of agitation,

336
00:11:47,280 --> 00:11:48,600
we still don't know.

337
00:11:49,000 --> 00:11:51,000
Based on the hemp rope clue,

338
00:11:51,080 --> 00:11:54,140
Song Yanfei doesn't meet
the conditions for a summons.

339
00:11:54,320 --> 00:11:55,280
From another perspective,

340
00:11:55,280 --> 00:11:56,760
if we question him,

341
00:11:56,760 --> 00:11:58,620
there are roughly two scenarios.

342
00:11:59,480 --> 00:12:01,440
The first is that he's actually guilty.

343
00:12:01,440 --> 00:12:02,160
If so,

344
00:12:02,400 --> 00:12:04,800
he would have prepared a perfect story

345
00:12:04,800 --> 00:12:05,680
to deal with us.

346
00:12:06,080 --> 00:12:07,160
Shen Xi is dead,

347
00:12:07,200 --> 00:12:08,280
so we have no way to verify it,

348
00:12:08,280 --> 00:12:08,800
right?

349
00:12:10,880 --> 00:12:12,360
The second scenario is that

350
00:12:12,360 --> 00:12:14,280
he just followed Shen Xi's arrangement

351
00:12:14,280 --> 00:12:15,960
and simply gave him a hemp rope.

352
00:12:15,960 --> 00:12:17,820
Then he would just tell the truth,

353
00:12:17,920 --> 00:12:19,440
and we wouldn't get anything out of him.

354
00:12:19,440 --> 00:12:20,480
Right now,

355
00:12:20,680 --> 00:12:23,410
the task force's opinion is
to not alert the enemy

356
00:12:23,480 --> 00:12:25,080
and look for a breakthrough.

357
00:12:25,280 --> 00:12:27,400
Especially to find out if he and Xiao Ze

358
00:12:27,400 --> 00:12:28,260
knew each other

359
00:12:28,560 --> 00:12:29,890
and what their past was.

360
00:12:32,840 --> 00:12:33,640
Yanfei,

361
00:12:34,480 --> 00:12:36,840
I really feel like
someone is following me.

362
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:37,970
I'm a little scared.

363
00:12:38,800 --> 00:12:40,120
Are you behind me?

364
00:12:58,880 --> 00:12:59,600
Who are you?

365
00:13:00,760 --> 00:13:02,220
Why are you following her?

366
00:13:02,400 --> 00:13:02,930
I just...

367
00:13:03,160 --> 00:13:03,800
Speak.

368
00:13:09,600 --> 00:13:10,400
No.

369
00:13:11,560 --> 00:13:12,320
Who are you?

370
00:13:14,320 --> 00:13:15,600
Is it any of your business?

371
00:13:15,600 --> 00:13:16,080
Get up.

372
00:13:18,200 --> 00:13:19,130
I'm her brother.

373
00:13:19,360 --> 00:13:20,360
What do you think?

374
00:13:21,760 --> 00:13:22,640
Her brother?

375
00:13:25,440 --> 00:13:27,300
Do you live in this neighborhood?

376
00:13:27,440 --> 00:13:29,240
I live in the building opposite.

377
00:13:32,120 --> 00:13:33,800
If I'm not mistaken,

378
00:13:34,680 --> 00:13:36,680
you can see Shen Xi's rooftop
from your place,

379
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:37,200
right?

380
00:13:39,600 --> 00:13:40,720
So you like Shen Xi.

381
00:13:48,040 --> 00:13:49,320
You pervert!

382
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:52,380
There's a small shop outside.

383
00:13:52,520 --> 00:13:54,250
Let's go out and talk about why.

384
00:14:13,000 --> 00:14:14,660
It's nothing. I just like you.

385
00:14:14,960 --> 00:14:15,890
I'll talk to him.

386
00:14:16,040 --> 00:14:16,770
Don't worry.

387
00:14:21,160 --> 00:14:22,120
Then be careful.

388
00:14:22,480 --> 00:14:23,440
Call me anytime.

389
00:14:23,680 --> 00:14:24,680
I'll wait for you.

390
00:14:27,920 --> 00:14:29,450
I don't drink this. Thanks.

391
00:14:33,880 --> 00:14:35,140
You studied dance too?

392
00:14:39,120 --> 00:14:40,050
How did you know?

393
00:14:40,760 --> 00:14:41,620
Just a feeling.

394
00:14:42,120 --> 00:14:43,360
You have a different vibe.

395
00:14:43,360 --> 00:14:44,760
I used to study dance too.

396
00:14:47,280 --> 00:14:48,140
What about now?

397
00:14:48,640 --> 00:14:49,320
Then

398
00:14:49,720 --> 00:14:51,720
my dad wouldn't let me dance anymore.

399
00:14:51,720 --> 00:14:52,200
Why?

400
00:14:52,800 --> 00:14:53,600
My dad said

401
00:14:53,720 --> 00:14:54,780
boys who study this

402
00:14:54,880 --> 00:14:56,600
will have a hard time finding a job.

403
00:14:56,600 --> 00:14:58,930
And it's useless for the family business.

404
00:14:59,320 --> 00:15:00,400
That's absurd.

405
00:15:02,080 --> 00:15:03,410
Since you're so honest,

406
00:15:05,320 --> 00:15:05,850
go ahead.

407
00:15:06,400 --> 00:15:07,320
What do you want to ask?

408
00:15:07,320 --> 00:15:08,780
I'll tell you everything.

409
00:15:09,120 --> 00:15:09,580
Really?

410
00:15:09,720 --> 00:15:10,400
Anything?

411
00:15:10,440 --> 00:15:10,960
Really.

412
00:15:12,960 --> 00:15:14,440
Are you her biological brother?

413
00:15:14,440 --> 00:15:15,160
Cousin.

414
00:15:16,840 --> 00:15:18,120
Do you visit her often?

415
00:15:18,560 --> 00:15:19,420
Occasionally.

416
00:15:19,640 --> 00:15:22,100
My aunt and uncle are
a bit worried about her,

417
00:15:22,120 --> 00:15:24,250
so I come to check on her occasionally.

418
00:15:26,480 --> 00:15:27,760
Did she spot me?

419
00:15:28,040 --> 00:15:29,120
How did she find out about me?

420
00:15:29,120 --> 00:15:29,920
You'll have to

421
00:15:30,440 --> 00:15:31,920
ask yourself that.

422
00:15:31,920 --> 00:15:34,250
Weren't you a bit too amateur at stalking?

423
00:15:34,400 --> 00:15:36,120
Do you know what she told me?

424
00:15:37,520 --> 00:15:38,680
She said a pervert

425
00:15:38,680 --> 00:15:40,680
was stalking her and about to make a move.

426
00:15:40,680 --> 00:15:41,740
That's you, right?

427
00:15:41,760 --> 00:15:43,280
I really didn't mean that.

428
00:15:43,520 --> 00:15:44,720
I just like her,

429
00:15:44,720 --> 00:15:46,180
so I wanted to see her more.

430
00:15:46,200 --> 00:15:47,240
I really didn't mean any harm.

431
00:15:47,240 --> 00:15:48,800
Please help me explain it to her.

432
00:15:48,800 --> 00:15:49,400
Calm down.

433
00:15:49,840 --> 00:15:51,440
If that's the case,

434
00:15:51,840 --> 00:15:54,500
why don't you just confess
your feelings to her?

435
00:15:57,720 --> 00:15:58,600
I'm too scared.

436
00:16:01,360 --> 00:16:02,560
Don't laugh at me, but

437
00:16:03,040 --> 00:16:05,440
when I was studying dance
at the art school,

438
00:16:05,800 --> 00:16:07,200
I liked a girl too.

439
00:16:09,120 --> 00:16:10,080
But until

440
00:16:10,080 --> 00:16:11,520
my dad forced me to drop out,

441
00:16:11,520 --> 00:16:13,450
I never had the courage to tell her.

442
00:16:13,880 --> 00:16:14,840
Shen Xi

443
00:16:16,120 --> 00:16:18,050
is the second girl I've ever liked.

444
00:16:27,360 --> 00:16:28,090
That's nice.

445
00:16:29,920 --> 00:16:31,160
If you behave well,

446
00:16:31,160 --> 00:16:32,840
I might consider giving you a chance

447
00:16:32,840 --> 00:16:34,240
to be my brother-in-law.

448
00:16:36,800 --> 00:16:37,520
Really?

449
00:16:37,840 --> 00:16:39,080
Don't lie to me.

450
00:16:39,400 --> 00:16:40,080
How will you help me?

451
00:16:40,080 --> 00:16:41,280
Why would I lie to you?

452
00:16:42,200 --> 00:16:43,160
But

453
00:16:44,240 --> 00:16:45,970
you have to listen to me on this.

454
00:16:46,120 --> 00:16:47,050
We can't rush it.

455
00:16:48,320 --> 00:16:49,520
I'll talk to her first

456
00:16:49,960 --> 00:16:51,000
and slowly

457
00:16:51,000 --> 00:16:51,860
plant the idea.

458
00:16:52,280 --> 00:16:53,400
Haste makes waste.

459
00:16:53,400 --> 00:16:54,320
You know that, right?

460
00:16:54,320 --> 00:16:55,120
I know.

461
00:16:55,200 --> 00:16:56,800
I'm definitely not in a rush.

462
00:17:04,000 --> 00:17:04,599
Eat.

463
00:17:33,120 --> 00:17:34,850
You still remember this place.

464
00:17:36,000 --> 00:17:36,960
Of course.

465
00:17:37,520 --> 00:17:39,320
Even if you forget, I never will.

466
00:17:41,080 --> 00:17:41,880
Never will?

467
00:17:44,000 --> 00:17:47,130
If you won't, why didn't you come to me
when you returned?

468
00:17:49,120 --> 00:17:51,040
Is it because of what happened to Uncle?

469
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:52,570
You still can't get over it.

470
00:17:58,160 --> 00:17:59,560
If I couldn't get over it,

471
00:18:00,600 --> 00:18:02,330
I wouldn't have come back here.

472
00:18:07,400 --> 00:18:10,080
You've been hiding from me, Song Yanfei.

473
00:18:12,800 --> 00:18:14,200
What are you hiding from?

